                "metadata": {
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Join Ariel, Minnie, Mickey, and all your Disney Junior friends in this fun-filled story collection! Hang out at the Clubhouse with Mickey, Minnie and the rest of the gang, attend a royal slumber party with Sofia the First, help Doc diagnose her toy patients, and so much more in these 13 exciting stories packed with magic and laughter!  \n\nThis collection includes: \n- Ariel: Cuttlebaby Sitter \n- Sofia the First: Finding Clover \n- Sofia the First: Royal Slumber Party \n- Doc McStuffins: Nightime \n- Doc McStuffins: Tea Party Tantrum \n- Mickey Mouse Clubhouse: Look Before You Leap \n- Mickey Mouse Clubhouse: Mickey and Donald Have a Farm \n- Minnie: Bloomin Bows Minnie: Trouble Times Two \n- Jake and the Neverland Pirates: Jake Saves Bucky \n- Jake and the Neverland Pirates: Save Me Smee \n- Henry Hugglemonster: Daddo Daycare \n- Henry Hugglemonster: Piano Lesson",
